    ["\n《我最喜欢的事情》\n我最喜欢在上课的时候闭上眼睛，因为很舒服。眼睛前面<Hide id=\"#157\">甲</>黑乎乎的，耳朵里面也黑乎乎的。\n拉夫老师说，起来！上课不许睡觉。\n原来我最喜欢的事情是上课<Hide id=\"#157\">睡</>垂觉。"] = "\n\"My Favorite Thing\"\nI like to close my eyes during class the most because it's very comfortable. In front of my eyes it's <Hide id=\"#157\">A</> pitch black, and inside my ears it's also pitch black.\nTeacher Ruff says, get up! No sleeping in class.\nSo my favorite thing is <Hide id=\"#157\">sleep</>ing in class.",
