    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诡秘圈-页签】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>关注页签：</>关注页签，会显示自己关注的玩家和NPC发布的诡秘圈动态。\n<Assistant_Title2>发现页签：</>发现页签会按照诡秘圈动态热度，自动推送当前热度较高的诡秘圈，可手动调整按照动态发布时间进行排序。\n<Assistant_Title2>话题页签：</>可以查看当前话题排行。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-动态]|1391}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-关系]|1392}，{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle - Tabs】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Following Tab: </>The Following tab displays updates from players and NPCs you follow in the Mysteries Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Discover Tab: </>The Discover tab automatically pushes trending Mysteries Circle posts based on their popularity. You can manually adjust the sorting to display by post time.\n<Assistant_Title2>Topics Tab: </>View current topic rankings.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Connections]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Topics]|1394}",
