    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数累积规则：</>\n团队副本通关每个阶段后可以领取<Highlight>1</>次奖励，共计<Highlight>3</>个阶段，每个阶段奖励次数每周增加<Highlight>1</>次，最多可累积到<Highlight>2</>次。\n不同难度的副本每周增加的奖励次数<Highlight>共上限</>，即每周可领取<Highlight>6</>次奖励。解锁新副本时，之前剩余的奖励次数不会累积到新副本上。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>初始奖励次数：</>\n新副本解锁时会额外获得<Highlight>1</>次初始奖励次数，<Highlight>初始奖励次数优先消耗，且不计入累计次数上限，也不受共上限影响</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>当前副本剩余奖励次数：</>\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n<Highlight>%s</>：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n参与人机模式仅消耗个人奖励次数，参与组队模式同时消耗个人奖励次数和公共奖励次数。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Accumulation Rules: </>\nAfter clearing each stage of a team dungeon, you can claim <Highlight>1</> reward, for a total of <Highlight>3</> stages. Reward counts for each stage increase by <Highlight>1</> weekly, up to a maximum of <Highlight>2</>. \nThe weekly reward count increase for different difficulties of dungeons <Highlight>shares a cap</>, meaning you can claim <Highlight>6</> rewards per week. When a new dungeon is unlocked, remaining reward counts from previous dungeons will not carry over. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initial reward counts: </>\nWhen a new dungeon is unlocked, you will receive an additional <Highlight>1</> initial reward count. <Highlight>Initial reward counts are consumed first and do not count towards the cumulative limit, nor are they affected by the shared cap.</> \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Remaining rewards for current dungeon: </>\n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \n<Highlight>%s</>: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</> \nParticipating in AI mode only consumes personal reward counts, while participating in party mode consumes both personal and public reward counts.",
